{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello our Mates! Welcome to the Boardgame World\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the ultimate gaming experience with Table Party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your friends and family together for laughter and fun, or play solo with our engaging AI. Dive into a growing collection of tabletop and casual games, all set in beautifully detailed interactive environments. Enjoy friendly competition, share unforgettable moments, and let the good times roll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yacht Dice \ud83c\udfb2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Othello \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chess \u265f\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Checkers \u26ab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rummy \u2666\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gin Rummy \u2663\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yut Nori \ud83e\udd62</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Omok \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Janggi \ud83c\udc04</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- One card \u2660\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stack Up \ud83d\udce6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flying Arrow \ud83c\udfaf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Whack a Mole \ud83d\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Catch the Ghost \ud83d\udc7b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Play solo against AI, or join a room with up to 4 human players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Create a party or use quick match to find online players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Meta avatar support: Show off your unique style with your personalized avatar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Win and record high scores on the global leader board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Explore and relax in a variety of different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Community Room: Up to 8 players can gather to organize games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Discover interactive extras such as Darts and Basketball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Latest Update!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Remodeling the community room with a hotel lounge concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Coming Soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- New licensed board game on Apr 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're constantly working to make Table Party the best place to hang out and have fun with friends in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have some exciting updates in the pipeline including more games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with the world for a fun competition!<br>Enjoy your play\u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2226150?t=1742215769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742215769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/5e6b843d0180dc3877c0237da7d8b4b3fab12bd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742215769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/5e6b843d0180dc3877c0237da7d8b4b3fab12bd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742215769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello our Mates! Welcome to the Boardgame World\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the ultimate gaming experience with Table Party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your friends and family together for laughter and fun, or play solo with our engaging AI. Dive into a growing collection of tabletop and casual games, all set in beautifully detailed interactive environments. Enjoy friendly competition, share unforgettable moments, and let the good times roll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yacht Dice \ud83c\udfb2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Othello \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chess \u265f\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Checkers \u26ab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rummy \u2666\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gin Rummy \u2663\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Yut Nori \ud83e\udd62</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Omok \u26aa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Janggi \ud83c\udc04</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- One card \u2660\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stack Up \ud83d\udce6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flying Arrow \ud83c\udfaf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Whack a Mole \ud83d\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Catch the Ghost \ud83d\udc7b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Play solo against AI, or join a room with up to 4 human players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Create a party or use quick match to find online players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Meta avatar support: Show off your unique style with your personalized avatar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Win and record high scores on the global leader board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Explore and relax in a variety of different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Community Room: Up to 8 players can gather to organize games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Discover interactive extras such as Darts and Basketball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Latest Update!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Remodeling the community room with a hotel lounge concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Coming Soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- New licensed board game on Apr 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're constantly working to make Table Party the best place to hang out and have fun with friends in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have some exciting updates in the pipeline including more games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with the world for a fun competition!<br>Enjoy your play\u2728</p>","developers":["DIVEXR CO.,LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/header.jpg?t=1742215769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257054754,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054754/movie480.mp4?t=1726234859","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054754/movie_max.mp4?t=1726234859"},"name":"Table Party Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054754/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726234859","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054754/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1726234859","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054754/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1726234859"}}],"name":"Table Party","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_fr